---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Citation Policy | H.K. Hangluah"
  description="Academic citation guidelines, copyright, and conditions of use for linguistic research materials."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-16 space-y-8 font-serif">
    <div class="border-b border-[var(--border-color)] pb-6 font-sans">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--accent)] font-semibold">
        Academic Legalities
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[var(--text-primary)] mt-1.5 mb-2">
        Terms of Use & Citation Guidelines
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] font-mono">
        Effective date: October 2026 • H. Kapginlian Hangluah
      </p>
    </div>

    <section class="space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-primary)]">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-sans tracking-tight text-[var(--text-primary)]">
        1. Academic Research & Open Access
      </h2>
      <p>
        The articles, working papers, linguistic glosses, and field recordings hosted on this website are published for scholarly, educational, and community language preservation purposes under a Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial (CC BY-NC 4.0) license, unless otherwise specified for specific third-party copyrighted materials.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-sans tracking-tight text-[var(--text-primary)] pt-4">
        2. Citation Guidelines
      </h2>
      <p>
        If you cite field data, interlinear glosses, or theoretical arguments from this website in your research or presentations, please cite the author accordingly:
      </p>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] border border-[var(--border-color)] font-mono text-xs text-[var(--text-secondary)]">
        Hangluah, H. Kapginlian. (2026). [Title of Essay or Note]. <em>H.K. Hangluah: Field Dispatches & Linguistic Notes</em>. Retrieved from https://hkhangluah.pages.dev
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-sans tracking-tight text-[var(--text-primary)] pt-4">
        3. Community Language Rights & Sensitive Data
      </h2>
      <p>
        Field audio and oral literature recordings were gathered with informed consent from language speakers and consultants. Commercial redistribution, re-licensing, or AI voice synthesis model training on raw speaker audio without explicit written consent is strictly prohibited.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
